          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "жалоба (zháloba) goes with жалеть 'to pity' and жаль 'a pity': to complain is to call for pity. EtymDB lists жалоба (zháloba) with the sense 'complaint' but without a source."
